{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>Despises the word</b> — [the one who despises] reproof will be cut off and corrupt his counsel." "<b>Fears the commandment</b> — for one who fears HaShem, he fears His commandment." "<b>Will be repaid</b> — he will sit in peace."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:31.639507657Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}